      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T21:17:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Breaking the relation clears the pin while the Cinder backend and its secret UUID survive. Re-relating to another cluster can then pin a different FSID under the existing backend identity. Could we keep the pin across relation loss and validate replacement settings before applying them?",
